# Path or URL of the backend's Liveblocks auth endpoint (see `backend/.env.example` for where
# the actual Liveblocks secret key lives — it is never used from the frontend).
# The default works out of the box in dev (proxied to the backend by vite.config.ts) and in any
# prod deployment where frontend and backend share an origin behind a reverse proxy.
# VITE_LIVEBLOCKS_AUTH_ENDPOINT=/api/liveblocks-auth
